        <STIG_DATA>
          <VULN_ATTRIBUTE>Vuln_Discuss</VULN_ATTRIBUTE>
          <ATTRIBUTE_DATA>Logging must be comprehensive to be useful for both intrusion monitoring and security investigations. Recording the start and stop events of HAProxy will provide useful information to investigators.</ATTRIBUTE_DATA>
