          <VULN_ATTRIBUTE>Rule_Title</VULN_ATTRIBUTE>
          <ATTRIBUTE_DATA>HAProxy expansion modules must be verified for their integrity (checksums) before being added to the build systems.</ATTRIBUTE_DATA>
