        <STIG_DATA>
          <VULN_ATTRIBUTE>Vuln_Discuss</VULN_ATTRIBUTE>
          <ATTRIBUTE_DATA>Being able to verify that a patch, upgrade, certificate, etc., being added to the web server is unchanged from the producer of the file is essential for file validation and non-repudiation of the information.

Expansion that are installed on the production HAProxy web server on vRA must be part of a documented build process. Checksums of the production files must be available to verify their integrity.</ATTRIBUTE_DATA>
